**Outputs declared** (flow-level `out` variables):
- `severity`, `engineeringNeeded`, `responseMode`, `caseKey`

### Classification policy in the script

| Condition | severity | engineeringNeeded | responseMode |
|---|---|---|---|
| `productionDown=true`, no workaround, enterprise/premium tier **or** high/critical impact | `SEV1` | `true` | `immediate` |
| `productionDown=true`, no workaround (all other tiers/impacts) | `SEV2` | `true` | `urgent` |
| `productionDown=true`, workaround available | `SEV2` | `true` if enterprise or critical, else `false` | `urgent` |
| `productionDown=false`, impact is `critical` or `high` | `SEV3` | `true` if enterprise, else `false` | `scheduled` |
| Everything else | `SEV4` | `false` | `standard` |

`caseKey` is formatted as `<severity>-<customerTier>-<correlationId>`.

